Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:37.97,sign_496_1_No_other_days_in,Text,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(2000,1)}No other days in Yokohama underground \Nsociety produced as many corpses as those 88 did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.09,0:00:37.97,sign_496_1_No_other_days_in,Text,0000,0000,0000,,{\an5\fad(2000,1)}Many organizations were \Ninvolved in that bloodbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:37.97,sign_826_3_The_Dragon_Head_,Text,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(2000,1)}The Dragon Head Conflict
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:48.52,sign_1069_4_The_night_before,Text,0000,0000,0000,,The night before its conclusion
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:03.40,Stray Dogs - Italics,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,This is sickening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:07.01,Stray Dogs - Italics,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,Corpses, no matter which way I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:29.45,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,You're lucky to be alive in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:31.58,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,Odasaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:32.78,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,Dazai, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:36.41,Stray Dogs - Italics,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,I have a feeling I know what you're up to, \Nbut you need to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.41,0:01:38.24,Stray Dogs - Italics,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not going to be safe there for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:41.12,Stray Dogs - Italics,Bike,0000,0000,0000,,Piss off, scrub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:46.44,Stray Dogs - Italics,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, Chuuya. You're in range of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:48.03,Stray Dogs - Italics,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,Take some bullets and die, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.03,0:01:49.38,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.42,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,Damn gifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:12.93,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,He thinks he's the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:30.19,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,It would have been more amusing if you'd \Nbeen struck by lightning and killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:34.96,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,Shut it, Dazai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.15,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,You're five minutes late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:43.88,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,Because of that, I got smacked \Nthree more times than I needed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:47.14,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,I might as well finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:02:50.46,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not the one you need to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:57.04,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,Look at all this trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.08,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,Clean it up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.52,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,You're prepared for this, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:07.75,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it,\N I have a debt to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:18.99,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.80,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be mine. {n: i get that this is likely supposed to be a play on "loves me, loves me not", but it's very awkward in english. I'd suggest "It'll be mine/It won't be mine" but it really doesn't have the same cadence and I'm unsure of a better alternative}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:23.93,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:26.40,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:28.76,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:31.29,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.33,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:35.85,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:37.96,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:40.44,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:42.57,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:45.13,Stray Dogs - Top,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.21,0:03:47.53,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,Those jewels are all real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:50.60,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,He could have made a woman really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:54.12,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be mine. {E: I think he's saying the - not - one} {n: agree, i hear "-nai"}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:04:02.54,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,It's not much fun seeing \Nthese readings come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:08.05,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,Starting an organization hasn't \Nhelped me get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.26,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,Give me back my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:16.69,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome, boring guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:22.43,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,I don't expect you to give me what I desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:26.69,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,Die now, as they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:31.42,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,All your friends killed themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:34.88,Stray Dogs - Default,Shibs,0000,0000,0000,,Boring people are boring, even in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:38.08,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:44.27,Stray Dogs - Default,Chuuka,0000,0000,0000,,Don't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:46.30,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:50.10,Stray Dogs - Default,Dasai,0000,0000,0000,,Corruption, huh? {n: his souped up power is "Corruption" in the bible}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.61,0:05:08.52,Stray Dogs - Default,Fjord,0000,0000,0000,,This is too much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.22,sign_7957_58_The_day_world_an,Text,0000,0000,0000,,The day world and the night world
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:36.60,sign_7957_58_The_day_world_an,Text,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HDFB88D&}An armed agency working in the twilight
